    "Description": "~mission(Contractor|RecoverSpaceDescriptionVeryHard)",
    "DescriptionKey": "spacecollect_cargo_desc_VH_01",
    "DisplayDescription": "RED WIND LINEHAUL\n'YOUR GOODS IN GOOD HANDS'\n----------------------------\n\nWe appreciate how hard you\u2019ve been working for us recently, which is why we\u2019d like to offer you this advanced contract. An important client of ours is waiting for delivery on multiple packages but the courier due to deliver them is no longer responding. The package trackers are showing that they\u2019re at <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4>, meaning we have some time to recover the delivery.\n\nPACKAGES TO RECOVER\n     \u00b7 <EM4>5x [Item1]</EM4>\n\nDROP OFF LOCATION\n     \u00b7 Deliver to <EM4>[Destination|Target|Address]</EM4>\n\nWe cannot stress enough how important the success of this delivery is. Since we do not know what happened to the original courier, we strongly urge you to travel with <EM4>several trustworthy combat pilots.</EM4>\n\nNeedless to say, we\u2019re offering a substantial payout for this one proportionate to the danger of the contract.\n\nTAKE PRIDE IN YOUR WORK \u2013 Even as a contractor you are representing Red Wind Linehaul. Do not intentionally do anything to harm the company\u2019s reputation.",
